    <item>
      <title>Harvestbeam 1.2.1</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 16:53:20 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>78</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[**Fixes:** the New Time Entry project list shows every project, not just the first 80.
- Typing a new time on a running entry and pressing Return stops the timer at that time instead of restarting it.]]></description>
