    <item>
      <title>Harvestbeam 1.1.0</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:54:38 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>60</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[**New look:** a cleaner, lighter window that matches the website.
- Locked entries show why they can't be edited (approved, invoiced or locked).
- Short days earlier in the week get a gentle nudge, which you can turn off in Preferences.
- Long names slide into view when you hover them.
- A star in the footer starts any favorite, and favorites drag either way.
- Clicking the menu bar icon no longer jumps into the search box; ⌥H still does.]]></description>
      <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/tractorbeam-user/harvestbeam/releases/tag/v1.1.0</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/tractorbeam-user/harvestbeam/releases/download/v1.1.0/Harvestbeam-1.1.0.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="fpI8LWECCCU9ggBss6+I/fZZAndFuhlHJ68vkOkc3l0ddF6/ac5YpkLLAIUjcSwViaYdtbCMNT4BPUM/CvSrDA==" length="8327831" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Harvestbeam 1.0.0</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 18:16:35 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>54</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[The first release. A menu bar timer for Harvest: press ⌥H anywhere to search, keep Favorites one click away, plan the day in a sentence, and handle idle time. Harvestbeam updates itself from here on.]]></description>
